List all triggers belonging to a specified Organization or Project.

USAGE:
  scw function trigger list [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [order-by]        Order in which to return results (created_at_asc | created_at_desc)
  [function-id]     ID of the function the triggers belongs to
  [namespace-id]    ID of the namespace the triggers belongs to
  [project-id]      Project ID to use. If none is passed the default project ID will be used
  [region=fr-par]   Region to target. If none is passed will use default region from the config (fr-par | nl-ams | pl-waw | all)

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for list
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use
